Brand new AISHU AnyShare Family 6.0 is a unified document cloud, which centrally stores, accesses and manages all unstructured data for enterprise. Its products and solutions cover the full life circle of unstructured data.

          Fully native experience, data accessed from anywhere by any device;
          Auto file sync and backup, large file one-click shared by link;
          Online preview, edit and comment files, online play videos;
          Auto watermark for file preview;
          Unified unstructured data storage, access and management;
